---
const capabilities = ['Parametric CAD', 'Rapid prototyping', 'Small-batch production', 'Design for manufacture'];
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden px-4 pb-16 pt-32 sm:px-6 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-40">
	<div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_20%_20%,rgba(249,115,22,0.15),transparent_45%)]"></div>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
		<p class="font-display text-orange-500 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">
			Product Design &middot; CAD &middot; 3D Printing
		</p>
		<h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight sm:text-6xl">
			From idea to finished part, <br class="hidden sm:block" /> engineered to work.
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
			Refinery.st is a product design studio. We take concepts through engineering-grade CAD, rapid
			prototyping, and small-batch production.
		</p>
		<div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4">
			<a
				href="#contact"
				class="rounded-full bg-orange-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-950 hover:bg-orange-400 transition-colors"
			>
				Request a quote
			</a>
			<a
				href="#services"
				class="rounded-full border border-zinc-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200 hover:border-zinc-500 transition-colors"
			>
				Explore services
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
	<ul class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-800 sm:grid-cols-4">
		{capabilities.map((capability) => (
			<li class="bg-zinc-950 px-4 py-5 text-center text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300">{capability}</li>
		))}
	</ul>
</section>
